  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only models outperform image-only resnet50, and scvi_n200 is the strongest tested RNA encoder in singleprofile settings, with validation accuracy 0.5203 and F1 0.4982. This experiment tests whether the best RNA representation improves when using multiprofile data with the simplest aggregation, avgpool, compared with the singleprofile scvi_n200 baseline. It is the best next experiment because it exploits the strongest current evidence while reducing uncertainty about profile setting and aggregation before moving to more complex choices such as transformer aggregation or multimodal fusion."
}

